{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"wand_adept_acolyte","model_identifier":"wand_adept_acolyte","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## wand_adept_acolyte\n\nMage wand, Adept Acolyte.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 32x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.7..0.7, y -0.7..0.7, z -9.3..2.0 (size 1.3 x 1.3 x 11.3 u = 4 x 4 x 32 cm).\nRank 3 of 6 (Adept Acolyte). Adept Acolyte wand: pale wood banded with cord and two iron bands, a leather grip, a clearer gem. About 32 cm. Held in slot_hand_r: grip at the origin, tip forward (-Z). The gem cube is named `glow_*` so the game can light it (violet).\n"},"description":"## wand_adept_acolyte\n\nMage wand, Adept Acolyte.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32 (padded from 32x16; UVs unchanged), 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.7..0.7, y -0.7..0.7, z -9.3..2.0 (size 1.3 x 1.3 x 11.3 u = 4 x 4 x 32 cm).\nRank 3 of 6 (Adept Acolyte). Adept Acolyte wand: pale wood banded with cord and two iron bands, a leather grip, a clearer gem. About 32 cm. Held in slot_hand_r: grip at the origin, tip forward (-Z). The gem cube is named `glow_*` so the game can light it (violet).\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"grip","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.5,-0.5,-1.5],"to":[0.5,0.5,2.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[4,9,5.0,10.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[16,7,19.5,8.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[5,9,6.0,10.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[20,7,23.5,8.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[2,0,3.0,3.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[3,0,4.0,3.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"29549626-6024-513a-bef8-427aa8efef52"},{"name":"shaft","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_o